{
 "total": 41.517,
 "frases": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "a": 0.15,
   "b": 1.471,
   "texto": "This deck railing won't hold you!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "a": 1.621,
   "b": 4.155,
   "texto": "Hit like and follow. Flo is leaning on it right now!",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "a": 4.275,
   "b": 7.73,
   "texto": "Relax! The post is screwed right into the deck. It's solid!",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "a": 7.85,
   "b": 10.538,
   "texto": "Screwed into one board. The outside rim. That's it.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "a": 10.658,
   "b": 14.451,
   "texto": "Lean on the top, and it works like a crowbar. It pries that board right off.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "a": 14.601,
   "b": 16.597,
   "texto": "Come on. How much can one lean do?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "a": 16.697,
   "b": 19.888,
   "texto": "Code says a railing must hold two hundred pounds, pushed on the top.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "a": 20.008,
   "b": 23.707,
   "texto": "In Virginia Tech tests, some screwed posts let go at about a quarter of that.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "a": 23.857,
   "b": 25.672,
   "texto": "Okay. So how do I fix it?",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "a": 25.772,
   "b": 29.794,
   "texto": "Tie the post into the deck joists. Blocking, through bolts, and a metal hold down.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "a": 29.914,
   "b": 32.347,
   "texto": "Now the push goes into the whole deck, not one board.",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "a": 32.497,
   "b": 34.578,
   "texto": "Fine. I'll lean on it. Carefully.",
   "h": 1
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "a": 34.778,
   "b": 39.317,
   "texto": "A railing screwed to the rim. Safe, or a fall waiting to happen? Team Norm or Team Flo?",
   "h": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "a": 39.517,
   "b": 41.517,
   "texto": "Follow for more backyard builds that won't fail!",
   "h": 0
  }
 ],
